[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ブレスレットの作成かぁ。この内容だと……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Making bracelets, huh? Looking at these requirements..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "たくさん作りたいのだけど、難しいかしら",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We need quite a few of them. Think it's possible?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ニーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうだなぁ……あ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well... Oh!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナなら大丈夫！\u3000おーい、レスナー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna can handle this! Hey, Resna!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ライザ先輩？\u3000何かあったんですか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miss Ryza? Did you need something?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "このお客さんの依頼を受けてみる気ない？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Want to take on this customer's request?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "つまり、ご説明通りのブレスレットをたくさん\n作ってほしいということですね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So you need a lot of bracelets made to these specifications?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ。神官長の依頼が調査団に来たんだけど、\n調査団じゃ、作り方が分かる人なんていないのよねぇ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. The High Priest sent this request to our research team, but none of us know how to make them."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ニーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そ、それをレイニャたちだけでやれなんて、\n無茶なんですよぅ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's impossible for just us to handle something like this..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レイニャ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lenja"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ざっと話を聞いた限りじゃ、エグい数だもんね～",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "From what I've heard, that's quite the tall order."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ウィルベル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wilbell"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "宝石を取り付ける最終加工は調査団でやるって\n聞いてるのよ。他の部分だけ……無理かしら？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The research team will handle setting the gemstones at the end. Could you make just the other parts?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ニーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そのようなお悩みを解決するのが、錬金術です。\nこの錬金術士レスナに安心してお任せください！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This is exactly the kind of problem alchemy can solve. Leave it to me, Resna the alchemist!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "れ、錬金術士！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A-an alchemist!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レイニャ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lenja"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんでそんなに驚いてるのかしら？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Why are you so surprised?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ウィルベル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wilbell"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "神聖国じゃ、この間まで錬金術士がいなかったから\nそのせいじゃない？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Maybe because Nova didn't have any alchemists until recently?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "れ、錬金術って禁忌なんじゃないんですか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I-isn't alchemy taboo?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レイニャ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lenja"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "待って。今聞くとややこしいことになるわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hold on. This isn't the time to get into that."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ニーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "見慣れない場所だとは思ってたけど、やっぱり\n私たちの常識が通用しない場所に来てしまったようね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I thought this place seemed unfamiliar, but it looks like we've ended up somewhere our common sense doesn't apply."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ニーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "とにかく今は、今後のためにお金を貯めることに\n専念しましょう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "For now, let's focus on earning money for what's ahead."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ニーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うぅ……それもそうですね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mmm... you're right."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レイニャ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lenja"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "錬金術士と会うのって珍しかったから……\nでも、それなら安心。よろしくね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Meeting an alchemist is quite rare for us... but that makes this perfect. Looking forward to working with you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ニーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい！\u3000では早速、素材の採取に行きますね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Right! Let's start by gathering materials!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私たちも同行していいかしら？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mind if we come along?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ニーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "自分で採取した素材でものを作るのは格別ですよね！\nぜひご一緒に！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Making things with materials you've gathered yourself is the best! Please join us!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "行き先は、良質な鉱物が採取できる……火山です！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We're headed to the volcano! That's where we can find high-quality minerals!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]